    {
      "text": "This diamond band is hard to resize.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "eternity-render.webp",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.5,
          "k": 1.2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a full eternity band, with stones all the way around.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "compare",
        "before": "eternity-cad.webp",
        "after": "eternity-render.webp"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A half eternity band has stones across the top only.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "signet-render.webp",
        "label": "Stones on top only",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.3,
          "k": 1.4
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The stones can sit in shared prongs, a channel, bezels or pavé.",
      "say": "The stones can sit in shared prongs, a channel, bezels or pah-vay.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "steps",
        "items": [
          "Shared prong",
          "Channel",
          "Bezel",
          "Pavé"
        ],
        "active": 0,
        "label": "Settings"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A bigger finger needs more stones to go all the way around.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "eternity-render.webp",
        "label": "More stones",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.62,
          "y": 0.45,
          "k": 1.8
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It stands for love that never ends,",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Eternity",
        "sub": "Love that never ends"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "and it's often given for a tenth anniversary or a first child.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "eternity-render.webp",
        "label": "10 years, or a first child",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.55,
          "y": 0.35,
          "k": 1.4
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Marilyn Monroe's band from Joe DiMaggio had 36 baguette diamonds.",
      "say": "Marilyn Monroe's band from Joe DiMaggio had thirty-six baguette diamonds.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "36 baguettes",
        "sub": "Marilyn Monroe's band"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A full band has no plain metal at the back to resize,",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "eternity-render.webp",
        "label": "Stones all around",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.68,
          "k": 2.0
        },
        "marks": [
          {
            "x": 0.58,
            "y": 0.72,
            "text": "No plain metal",
            "at": 0.4
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "so the finger size has to be right before it's made.",
      "scene": {
